WEBVTT

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:15.250
I don't know what I should do.

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:16.790
But!

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:18.950
This is wrong!

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:20.580
I don't like this!

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:06.330
Don't even think about escaping.

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:09.830
"Aircraft Carrier <i>Ark Royal</i> "

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:11.660
"Aircraft Carrier <i>Ark Royal</i> "

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:11.660
We've got an eye on you.

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:12.410
"Aircraft Carrier <i>Ark Royal</i> "

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:12.410
But it's not like we're trying
to eat you alive or anything.

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:13.830
But it's not like we're trying
to eat you alive or anything.

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:20.450
Is this the Azur Lane base?

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:24.700
You know a lot, as expected.
You did your research.

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:26.120
After the battle...

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:30.750
...you were unconscious
and we picked you up.

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:34.160
Officially, you're a prisoner of war.

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:39.410
What about those two? How are they?

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:42.700
Worried about them, are you?

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:26.200
Seriously, that was really reckless of you.

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:29.870
A thoughtless charge,
in order to save an enemy.

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:34.500
I have to say, it's not something
we'd give out medals for.

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:36.160
I'm sorry.

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:40.080
Please wait. I am the one who set them off.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:42.830
It is I who should be held responsible.

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:45.330
You say that, but...

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:47.950
We need to send
the right message to the others.

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:52.250
So it's decided, then.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:55.370
Laffey, Javelin,
as punishment for your actions,

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:57.700
the two of you are assigned
to prisoner supervision duties.

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:02.750
Prisoners of war need to be taken
good care of. Those are the rules.

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:04.160
So that means...

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:05.660
We're counting on you.

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:06.870
Yes!

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:12.120
I can't believe I let them
have such a sweet deal.

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.120
Don't overthink it.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.370
That's right.

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:19.500
Coffee, tea, and life in general...

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.450
Being sweet makes everything better.

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:24.870
At any rate... This here is the real problem.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:29.910
The Cube...

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.830
Ever since that battle,

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:34.950
the Cube has been
behaving quite abnormally.

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:38.950
Unfortunately, there is no way
to know what exactly this means.

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:42.580
The Black Mental Cube
is the key to Project Orochi...

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:45.870
There is no doubt that this is
part of a plot by the Sirens.

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:50.370
This probably has something
to do with my sister, right?

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:56.700
How is Enterprise?

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:59.580
We are performing diagnostics
on her body and her gear,

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:02.750
but so far, we have not found
anything out of the ordinary.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:05.870
I always thought she was
an exceptional ship, but...

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:18.290
Back there, Enterprise was... terrifying.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:34.660
Oh, there you are.

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:37.330
Your checkups aren't done yet.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.620
You need to stay put.

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:42.620
Yes... Sorry.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:46.950
Enterprise...

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.620
Are you okay?

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:50.250
Yes.

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:54.040
No matter what happens, for now,
there is no choice for us but to fight.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:56.830
Don't you agree?

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.250
Enterprise...

00:06:04.580 --> 00:06:09.290
I don't understand, Yorktown.

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:17.330
The beauty of the ocean,
the emotions placed on my name...

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:18.830
I don't understand a thing.

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:32.200
First off, we have to go buy
the things you'll need!

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:38.700
You'll be living here for a while,
so you'll be needing things.

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:40.790
The shop has things.

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:43.080
Yeah, let's go!

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:56.370
Hey! Over here!

00:07:00.450 --> 00:07:02.700
"Light Aircraft Carrier <i>Borg</i> "

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:06.500
Wow! Cool!

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:09.040
A promising rookie has arrived!

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:16.200
You must be the ship Ayanami.

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:20.200
"Destroyer <i>Charles Ausburne</i> "

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:23.000
"Destroyer <i>Thatcher</i> "                "Destroyer <i>Aulick</i> "

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:23.000
Yay! A new girl!

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.160
"Destroyer <i>Thatcher</i> "                "Destroyer <i>Aulick</i> "

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.160
Yep, that's got to be the one, leader!

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:25.910
Yep, that's got to be the one, leader!

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:27.950
That's the girl from Sakura Empire!

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:29.830
"Destroyer <i>Foote</i> "                   "Destroyer <i>Spence</i> "

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:29.830
S-Sakura Empire?!

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:34.290
I heard the stories.

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:38.370
I heard you fought to protect
your Sakura Empire friends.

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:42.830
Putting yourself in harm's way
to save a friend...

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:44.160
That's justice!

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:49.910
Laffey, Javelin, you two did great as well.

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:54.950
You're an ally of justice, too.

00:07:54.950 --> 00:08:00.040
If you need any help,
we Little Beavers will be there for you.

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:03.580
Um, thanks.

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:07.700
See you again soon. Justice calls!

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:10.500
E-Excuse me!

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:12.830
Let's play games together sometime!

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:16.950
Don't worry.

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:21.040
Nobody thinks badly of you.

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:23.120
Come on, let's go!

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:27.830
This feels... weird.

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:37.410
Welcome.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:45.370
What are you doing here, Akashi?

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:50.080
I can do business anywhere in the world
as long as there are customers.

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:52.700
Hey, any chance of a discount on this?

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:54.580
Not even in the slightest.

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:56.080
Boo! Stingy!

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:59.660
After Akashi came, the selections got better!

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:02.660
We were all worried about you.

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:10.000
Akagi, with the Sirens...?

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:15.870
Akagi can be scary, but she wasn't the type
to go behind her friends' backs.

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:18.790
What's going to happen
to the Sakura Empire?

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:20.830
I don't know...

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:25.160
Hey, Ayanami!

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:27.040
Which one do you like?

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:32.620
Come on, pick!

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:34.290
This one, for sure.

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:48.790
Ayanami!

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:54.290
Ayanami... Captured by the enemy...

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:58.200
I'm sorry... I couldn't bring her back.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:01.450
No, Zuikaku, it's not your fault...

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:08.120
Is Ayanami okay? Are they bullying her?

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:11.250
She's not a lucky ship like I, Yukikaze, am...

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:13.000
So maybe...

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:19.830
I was supposed to be the rear guard,

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:19.830
Ayanami!

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:22.200
but she saved me instead...

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:25.620
Hey, hey! You all are getting too negative!

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:28.620
What if they weren't feeding her...?

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:31.790
What if she was the only one
not being served meat...?

00:10:31.790 --> 00:10:33.830
If only I had been stronger...

00:10:34.500 --> 00:10:38.160
What is this heavy mood?!

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:47.660
So Akagi did not return.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:51.580
We lost Akagi, the commander
of the entire operation,

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:55.540
and the Black Box remains
in Azur Lane's hands.

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:58.290
The situation is quite serious.

00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:03.500
Kaga strongly insists on
pushing forward with Project Orochi.

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:06.830
Are you suspicious of her?

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:10.700
It's too dangerous to
move forward with the project.

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:13.450
Doubting a friend is
the last thing I want to do, but...

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:15.370
"Battleship <i>Mutsu</i> "

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:17.370
"Destroyer <i>Kawakaze</i> "

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:19.660
Thank you for waiting.

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:26.000
Things are getting really serious out here.

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:29.160
The Sakura Empire are in a perilous situation.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:34.700
We Iron Blood are their allies.
Shouldn't we be taking action at this time?

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:39.290
Are you suggesting we attack
Sakura Empire while they are confused?

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:41.290
Z23, that's very sinister of you.

00:11:41.290 --> 00:11:44.200
You know that's not what I meant!

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:46.160
I'm just joking.

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:48.870
You just can't wait to go rescue Ayanami.

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:52.330
You two seemed close...
Maybe a bit too close.

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:57.330
I-It's nothing personal like that! It's not!

00:11:57.330 --> 00:12:00.620
But she's right that this is
the right time to make a move.

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:02.620
What are we going to do?

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:05.750
H-Here is your <i>anmitsu</i> ...

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:09.160
Oh, how cute.

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.830
I can eat you whole.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:13.120
Miss, please refrain!

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:16.250
Pay attention!

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:18.370
Well then.

00:12:18.370 --> 00:12:20.290
What to do.

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:25.620
Nice shot.

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:27.620
Impressive as always, Your Majesty.

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:32.160
Nice shot!

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:38.540
What are the Sirens?

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:43.870
Our enemy--from where do they come
and what do they seek?

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:46.830
The question we've asked so many times.

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:50.160
There's no way to come up with an answer,

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:54.540
but why do the Sirens
interact with humanity?

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:59.950
If their goal was to eradicate humanity,
they don't need to be so indirect.

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:06.160
The key to this is Project Orochi, and...

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:10.410
Nice par!

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:14.910
Enterprise, Your Majesty?

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:22.660
Come to think of it, Illustrious always
had an eye on Enterprise.

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:26.870
She really has an uncanny wit.

00:13:26.870 --> 00:13:30.450
That's why I assigned Belfast to Enterprise.

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:33.830
I wonder if Belfast sees something in her?

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:39.700
What we had feared has come true.

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:46.580
You must have noticed, about Enterprise.

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:55.450
No matter how powerful she is,
her heart is still delicate and at risk.

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:01.330
We all know it.

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:04.700
It was unavoidable.

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:09.750
Enterprise must now face herself.

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:14.000
Will she recover?

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:17.200
I cannot say.

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:24.040
I think Enterprise is afraid of the sea.

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:29.410
But still, she saved me.

00:14:31.660 --> 00:14:34.540
Yes, you are correct.

00:14:45.450 --> 00:14:49.120
Where are we going? Away from the base?

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:53.750
Akashi took care of the daily necessities, so...

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:55.540
Today, we're...

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.250
Good day.

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:08.540
Illustrious and Unicorn!

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:14.870
What are you doing out here?

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:17.080
Well, we're...

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:18.250
On a date.

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:24.700
Huh?

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:54.620
It's busy out here as always!

00:15:54.620 --> 00:15:57.080
By date, you mean...

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:58.700
We play together.

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:05.700
Come on, Unicorn!

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:44.330
Wow! Looks delicious!

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:46.950
Let's eat!

00:16:46.950 --> 00:16:48.660
Let's eat.

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:06.870
Oops.

00:17:15.370 --> 00:17:19.040
Behold, the might of the Demon!

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:20.500
Bring it.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:27.540
Come on, mind your manners.

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:32.540
Can't they be classier?

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:40.160
Priceless...

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:43.120
Ark Royal, your nose is bleeding.

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:55.870
What's the food like in Sakura Empire?

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:00.370
It's the same.

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:02.000
The same?

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:07.160
The grown ups and the younger ones
are all friendly together.

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:10.450
Sharing delicious meals.

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:14.580
The same.

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.500
Are you okay?!

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:23.660
It's a shallow cut.

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.910
D-Don't worry, I will disinfect this...

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.250
Million headbutt!

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:22.540
The Orochi awakens, with the wills
of countless souls embedded in its body.

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:26.000
The Orochi contains everything.

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:31.200
It has travelled every sea, collecting wills.

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:32.700
Wills...

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:38.160
That's right. Akagi's will is here as well.

00:19:38.160 --> 00:19:41.120
You must not let it end.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:43.700
Yes, that's right.

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:45.450
That's why I...

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:18.200
What is this, an escape?

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:23.660
I'm joking.

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:26.620
Having trouble sleeping?

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:31.700
I don't understand.

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:38.000
Azur Lane is my enemy.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:41.910
But everyone is so nice to me.

00:20:41.910 --> 00:20:45.370
The fighting, Sakura Empire...

00:20:45.370 --> 00:20:47.870
The more I try to think about everything,

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:51.080
the less I understand anything.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:56.040
I've been unable to understand
anything for a while now.

00:20:56.040 --> 00:20:58.910
Do you still want to fight?

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:00.790
I don't know.

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:03.250
I don't know, but...

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:06.410
I don't like fighting.

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:08.080
I see.

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:09.750
I am the same.

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:46.290
Thanks for finding U- <i>chan</i> that day.

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:51.620
I really didn't do anything.

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:55.950
I was an enemy spy, infiltrating this base...

00:21:55.950 --> 00:21:58.580
But that's how we were able to meet.

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:06.450
How did you find such a great spot?
You must have skills!

00:22:08.080 --> 00:22:12.000
I'm Javelin, and this is...

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:14.250
Laffey.

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:14.250
Unicorn.

00:22:15.950 --> 00:22:18.370
Can I ask your name?

00:22:22.450 --> 00:22:25.790
I'm Ayanami.

00:22:25.790 --> 00:22:27.330
Nice to meet you.

00:22:28.870 --> 00:22:34.290
<i>The ripples seeing each other</i>

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:40.040
<i>Are messages exchanged with you</i>

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:46.080
<i>Connecting us across this blue ocean</i>

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:51.700
<i>Guideposts of light</i>

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:57.370
<i>Have you met someone nice?</i>

00:22:57.370 --> 00:23:03.040
<i>Are your days filled with smiles?</i>

00:23:03.040 --> 00:23:08.540
<i>Filling your melancholy eyes with light</i>

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:13.620
<i>When the starshine wanes in them</i>

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:19.500
<i>I'm close to you</i>

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:25.620
<i>Always by your side</i>

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:30.870
<i>you can't see the next day</i>

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:37.160
<i>I am calling out to your heart</i>

00:23:37.160 --> 00:23:42.080
<i>Please stay with me</i>

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:48.120
<i>Please don't give up</i>

00:23:48.120 --> 00:23:57.200
<i>Until the morning comes</i>
<i>when we can hold hands</i>
